<title>SINGAPORE: Seksun says bonus issue not approved.</title>
<headline>Seksun says bonus issue not approved.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seksun Precision Engineering Ltd said on Thursday its application for a bonus issue of 36.75 million new shares had not been approved by the Stock Exchange of Singapore (SES).</p>
<p>A company statement gave no reason for the SES decision or further details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
